      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:1142896deb8f4c89",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Name the four words of this chapter so far."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: अंग्रेज़ी",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अंग्रेज़ी (angrezī) — \"English\", the language."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The route is long and worth following. Portuguese traders said inglês; Persian took it as انگریز (angrez), \"an Englishman\"; Hindi added the ending -ी that turns a people into their language, and अंग्रेज़ी (angrezī) came out. The nuqta under ज़ is the z you learnt with the letters."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Set it beside हिंदी, which is built the same way: हिंद, the land, plus the same ending. भाषा (bhāshā) is the word for the class of thing; हिंदी and अंग्रेज़ी (angrezī) are two members of it."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Both listening papers you will one day sit key on somebody speaking two of these, so the pair matters more than either word alone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Five: देश (desh), भारत (Bhārat), शहर (shahar), भाषा (bhāshā), अंग्रेज़ी (angrezī). Enough to say what country you are in, what city you live in, and what you speak."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
